# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Purpose    : Paths both products ignore when a watchdog classifies a change.
# Note       : One path or one prefix per line. A directory prefix ends with a slash.
# Note       : ip:address and scenario:name apply to CrowdSec and Fail2Ban.
# Note       : The product file config/alert/exclude.list is added to this one.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

/var/log/
/var/cache/apt/
/var/lib/apt/lists/
/var/lib/snapd/sequence
